[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0010","text":"……好痛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0020","text":"……制作人？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0030","text":"累了？\n没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0040","text":"啊，嗯\n就是肩膀有点酸……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0050","text":"嗯——，大概是因为太忙了，\n一直没什么机会运动吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0060","text":"这方面，巡可是很喜欢运动的呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0070","text":"嗯！\n又清爽又开心！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0080","text":"如果运动能让人精神起来的话，\n真希望制作人也试试呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0090","text":"哈哈，巡说得对\n我也得好好锻炼才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300900_01_0100","text":"────！\n呐，制作人！"}]
